hostname device1
!
no aaa root
!
username admin privilege 15 role network-admin secret admin
!
ip routing
!
interface Ethernet1
   description administration subnet
   no switchport
   ip address 192.168.99.1/24
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet2
   description guest subnet
   no switchport
   ip address 192.168.50.1/24
   no shutdown
!
management api http-commands
   protocol https
   no shutdown
!
end
